id: pm-gh1568
title: "GH-1568: keep read-only commands from recreating missing workflow schema files"
description: Shared settings hydration loads optional schema files without materializing missing files. SDK and CLI get/list/context/search preserve schema absence; explicit initialization retains repair. Schema migration preserves a typed missing-custom-definition refusal without creating its absent optional input. Original GH1568 reproduction remains preserved.
