resolution: "Settings reads load optional schema sections in memory without scaffolding; explicit init repairs missing sections, cache signatures retain absence, and migrations report missing custom definitions without ENOENT or writes."
expected_result: "SDK and CLI reads preserve absent workflows.json and existing schema bytes, while explicit schema mutation boundaries retain their intended behavior."
actual_result: The affected231-test selection and linked SDK/settings/migration/preview suite pass. Successful and refused get plus list/context/search preserve absence; explicit init repairs it; missing whole schema directories remain readable. All14 hosted platform legs and exact full-source coverage pass on source3ecc13b6a.
